Greetings!

The other day playing yet another wizard I stumbled upon not less than
three altars on level 2 in the Dungeons of Doom.  There was one for
each alignment.  Was that a really special combination of random
numbers when the level was generated, or was it some kind of special
level?  If it was a special level I would say that it somehow lacked
atmosphere since it looked like any other level 2 (except for the
altars).

Needles to say my wizard died for some silly reasons a few levels
down.

BTW, I discovered that in wizard mode (which I have in 3.1.1) one can
wish for altars.  I don't know if it's possible with a wand of
wishing, but it could be handy in an otherwise good game where you
just missed an altar (if thats possible - I mean to have a good game
without altars).

